</span>
</span>Urgent order (Alt+R)</label>
<label data-aria-id="true" class="lims-switch" data-rac="">
<span style="border: 0px; clip: rect(0px 0px 0px 0px); clip-path: inset(50%); height: 1px; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; padding: 0px; position: absolute; width: 1px; white-space: nowrap;">
<input data-aria-id="true" tabindex="0" role="switch" type="checkbox">
</span>
<span class="lims-switch-track" aria-hidden="true">
<span class="lims-switch-thumb">
</span>
</span>Downtime back-entry</label>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lims-card">
